# .cursorrules — stripe-mcp

You are working on stripe-mcp, an MCP server and SOTA React webapp providing Stripe payment tools and Austrian/EU tax compliance.

## Guidelines
- FastMCP 3.4+ standard
- Windows host environment: use PowerShell and `uv`
- Ports: 11165 (backend) and 11166 (frontend)
- Always test with `uv run pytest` and lint with `uv run ruff check .`
- Ensure Austrian VAT (20%/10%/13%), EU ATU VAT validation, and BAO 7-year invoice retention schema are strictly followed
